# Broken

units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p

neighbor 6 bin

atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 3.62

region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box 1 box

create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 63.546
pair_style lj/cut 9
pair_coeff * * 0.59 2.2773

variable eatom equal pe/atoms

thermo 1
run 0
print "E/N = ${eatom}"

fix relax all box/relax iso 0.0 vmax 0.01
min_style cg
minimize 1.0e-4 1.0e-6 1000 10000
print "E/N = ${eatom}"

write_data cu_lj.dat